  "tables": [],
  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Use `ConsumptionRequest` to provide information about the customer’s In-App Purchase when you call the `Send-Consumption-Information` endpoint.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/Send-Consumption-Information"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Note**\n>\n> The App Store server rejects requests that have a `customerConsented` value other than `true` by returning an `HTTP 400` error with an `InvalidCustomerConsentedError`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/customerConsented",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/InvalidCustomerConsentedError"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can provide consumption information for any type of product: consumable, non-consumable, non-renewing subscription, and auto-renewable subscription.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Consider the following constraints when providing an optional `refundPreference`:",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/ConsumptionRequest/refundPreference"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the `deliveryStatus` isn’t `DELIVERED`, set the `consumptionPercentage` to `0`; otherwise the request fails with an error.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/ConsumptionRequest/deliveryStatus"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The system supports the `GRANT_FULL` and `DECLINE` values for all product types.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "If you choose `GRANT_PRORATED` for an auto-renewable subscription, don’t include a `consumptionPercentage`. The system automatically calculates the percentage.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/ConsumptionRequest/consumptionPercentage"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
